  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "要领略济南的美，根本须有些诗人的态度。",
      "output_sha256": "2baeb7d5667ecfc3b6ab53c9bc9e9a7bbd8c8988dc5be7bbde6b12b8fad09224",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "2baeb7d5667ecfc3b6ab53c9bc9e9a7bbd8c8988dc5be7bbde6b12b8fad09224",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "那就是说：你须客气一点，把不美之点放在一旁，而把湖山的秀丽轻妙地放在想象里浸润着；这也许是看风景而不至于失望的普通原则。",
      "output_sha256": "b9549df2178fba80b78116c78aa90a23b38746203faaa15eccc75ee0da921377",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "b9549df2178fba80b78116c78aa90a23b38746203faaa15eccc75ee0da921377",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "反之，你没有这诗意的体谅，而一个萝卜一个坑的去逛大明湖，趵突泉等，先不用说别的，单是人们口中的葱味，路上吱吱妞妞小车子的轮声，与裹着大红袜带的小脚娘们，要不使你想悬梁自尽，那真算万幸。",
      "output_sha256": "64e1cb6a2629811dc316a7a3b6c392449d19d80335b3b3cdec7a1dc801221fc0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "64e1cb6a2629811dc316a7a3b6c392449d19d80335b3b3cdec7a1dc801221fc0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "光听济南人的话，谁能想象这里有如此美丽、甜美与清凉的泉水；然而，济南泉水的确是甘甜清凉的事实，你不能因为济南话的粗犷而否认这一神圣的馈赠。",
      "output_sha256": "2d789304dbe2742919948f3cc678dc5c16cadf8151928ebb821645288e63ce1e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.568525,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2583480f0aaab8b9c8aea5eb64c4c48b096fb9cd2c1e434606df8727381e67dd"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2d789304dbe2742919948f3cc678dc5c16cadf8151928ebb821645288e63ce1e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "好吧，你随我来吧，假如你要对济南下公平的判断，一个公平的判断，永不会使济南损失一点点的光荣。",
      "output_sha256": "4c6343512dea514c1bee366b0199e553f731e4a060e6e5f6190177e29344802d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "4c6343512dea514c1bee366b0199e553f731e4a060e6e5f6190177e29344802d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "比如，先跟我去大明湖的北极阁吧，沿途（无论从哪里出发），请尽量不去关注周围的喧嚣。",
      "output_sha256": "d84a44335da6bacf1755bfcfa4d4050362b8cdbe0c08588bcd10affaf7304f70",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.535754,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "bfde404aee5677ed6e0e50e0351a46c81af4c988914a95edf8897ca4edd50b0c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d84a44335da6bacf1755bfcfa4d4050362b8cdbe0c08588bcd10affaf7304f70",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6,
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "如果你不愿意闭上眼睛、捂住耳朵，至少得决定：不让路上的丑陋影响你最终的判断。",
      "output_sha256": "d1acce9f09778137a4655096eb0a7d2f13c8cecde65ce8870d3d16f36eedfbe9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.535754,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "bfde404aee5677ed6e0e50e0351a46c81af4c988914a95edf8897ca4edd50b0c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d1acce9f09778137a4655096eb0a7d2f13c8cecde65ce8870d3d16f36eedfbe9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6,
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你还要必诚必敬的默想着，你是去看个地上的仙境。",
      "output_sha256": "eaaec891932badf81f4b54b1dcfe8552427d62514a02d0f261ebf9bb6bf55fdd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "eaaec891932badf81f4b54b1dcfe8552427d62514a02d0f261ebf9bb6bf55fdd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "到了之后，先别看脚下的湖水；请将目光投向南方的山峦。",
      "output_sha256": "f8b374f263b2a8437bd4821f7a298cbaa656994973ad427125f738f7ca39ec0d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": 0.533068,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        8,
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d6cbabd6b820adc549635a2b3c0796d222b131500dc95df172d9abfd1d137bdc",
        "23c461b7103eef93eb6a9d9cf4b745fb4043c1acc2179f8884bb98e7e03f6331"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f8b374f263b2a8437bd4821f7a298cbaa656994973ad427125f738f7ca39ec0d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "看那腰中深绿，而头上淡黄的千佛山；看后面那个塔，只是那么一根黑棍儿似的，可是似乎把那一群小山和那片蓝而含着金光的天空联成一体，它好像表现着群山的向上的精神。",
      "output_sha256": "fb0dc1058641caf54e6cd7a78e20102d28600d6cbcf7e13ecd0d0d1d0ca42850",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "fb0dc1058641caf54e6cd7a78e20102d28600d6cbcf7e13ecd0d0d1d0ca42850",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "再往西看，一串小山都像带着不同的绿色往西走呢。",
      "output_sha256": "1d6d758cab4fec1918402b46018853be6ff3d5f50d7e9dd51585829ad82054d4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "1d6d758cab4fec1918402b46018853be6ff3d5f50d7e9dd51585829ad82054d4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "远处，只见天边上一些蓝的曲线，随着你的眼力与日光的强弱，忽隐忽现，使你轻叹一声：山，伟大图画中的诗料。",
      "output_sha256": "61429d002b9a8a13ed10b4c1ac35b011ec78c78feb94311b7b41e82727d906f5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "61429d002b9a8a13ed10b4c1ac35b011ec78c78feb94311b7b41e82727d906f5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "当来到北极阁后面，依旧能看到那古老的历山，懒得长树的华山，都是恰到好处的高度，宛如一圈小绿屏障围绕着城市；在这方面，济南仿佛和意大利的佛罗伦萨有些相似。",
      "output_sha256": "031e4770c491374a25d1ca3f4cfc46dbe02784d1b3126ab4095a5039c7a6e561",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": 0.450225,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "424fb183cda7129aa69b67385eef35fb6b5e89cf52e4fb7d396573849bd0d6bf"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_ai_sha256": "031e4770c491374a25d1ca3f4cfc46dbe02784d1b3126ab4095a5039c7a6e561",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你看到这几乎形成一个圆圈的小山，你开始，无疑的，爱济南了。",
      "output_sha256": "4aad46ffe288e1c304f9ace516d8ac204a45d18554ac89b881d9c094ce7d42c3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "4aad46ffe288e1c304f9ace516d8ac204a45d18554ac89b881d9c094ce7d42c3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这群小山不像南京的山那样可怕，不像北平的西山北山那样荒伟的在远处默立，这些小山“就”在济南围墙的外边，它们对济南有种亲切的感情，可以使你想到它们也许愿到城里来看看朋友们。",
      "output_sha256": "2d1596af762e343211caff9e4646061ab162bf910d52a6bcc62e28944de6c785",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "2d1596af762e343211caff9e4646061ab162bf910d52a6bcc62e28944de6c785",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "不然，它们为什么总像向城里探着头看呢。",
      "output_sha256": "8d1a57bc73d1c4e87f55c06db023c21795d1cca435d4e9fb0492869c259b4e17",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "8d1a57bc73d1c4e87f55c06db023c21795d1cca435d4e9fb0492869c259b4e17",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "看完了山，请你默想一会儿：山是不错，但是只有山，不能使济南风景像江南吧；水可是不易有的，在中国的北方。",
      "output_sha256": "1bf2459ee88ae96500a75efd1afac6aaac48e6ac244431fd450450db9cab545c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "1bf2459ee88ae96500a75efd1afac6aaac48e6ac244431fd450450db9cab545c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这么想罢，请看大明湖吧。",
      "output_sha256": "286ea4b598acaa8afd77c6b5a86a2cef4731b4627b5044384d2255e1f69212ec",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "286ea4b598acaa8afd77c6b5a86a2cef4731b4627b5044384d2255e1f69212ec",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "自然，现在的湖已成了许多水沟，使你大失所望。",
      "output_sha256": "9cbc64daee2da0ac1f086926175e67bd60d42f4f6ffd1b445ebf8f30c73761d8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "9cbc64daee2da0ac1f086926175e67bd60d42f4f6ffd1b445ebf8f30c73761d8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我知道，所以我不请你坐小船去游湖，那些名胜，什么历下亭咧，铁公祠咧，都没有什么可看；那些小船既不美，又不贱，而且最恼人的是不划不摇不用篙支不用纤拉，而以一根大棍硬“挺”的驶船方法。",
      "output_sha256": "ff23e0b346227deedaa5d3a9b10b6ff3fa14cb4b5df09a6c4ba362aa5aba80dd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "ff23e0b346227deedaa5d3a9b10b6ff3fa14cb4b5df09a6c4ba362aa5aba80dd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "这些我们都不去尝试，我只想请你想象：要是湖上没有那些蒲田泥坝，这湖的面积该有多大？",
      "output_sha256": "2f662dfeb6ae091517c773f86234154d4830588f9102b18b47a4599aac203d8c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": 0.724151,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "573fddd1453c5e9e68a96ff33902faee781bad6c945c64840c7fda73329c196d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2f662dfeb6ae091517c773f86234154d4830588f9102b18b47a4599aac203d8c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "如果湖面上全种着莲花，四周环绕着杨柳，那不就是一幅诗意的画面？",
      "output_sha256": "ede246cf3fa7c03643c66270c28fb33bd48045ff4e03532f6c3e683dca2b1012",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": 0.494143,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4d02950ea13f8e67a9340df906038cf5f5f5eb6b216b9fdfc76aa7b5cd0dd29f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ede246cf3fa7c03643c66270c28fb33bd48045ff4e03532f6c3e683dca2b1012",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "这并非不可能；本来这湖是个“湖”，却被人改造成了许多“水沟”；上帝给了济南一些小山，也赋予了它一个大湖，然而人为的改变让湖泊失去了美丽，这不是自然的过错，而是人心的匮乏。",
      "output_sha256": "be13c2952e934b7ca869fb9201fa96d586176360130fb3e82847ae1b01372792",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": 0.606425,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4422467555bb928c2036b8632c3c3108a819f8667f97d644719766ae244ddc26"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "be13c2952e934b7ca869fb9201fa96d586176360130fb3e82847ae1b01372792",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "城在山下，湖在城中。",
      "output_sha256": "6f6c7dbc419a2985173ac4f92dc71f4391ef626adf160181b3510f4cd179b6d5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "6f6c7dbc419a2985173ac4f92dc71f4391ef626adf160181b3510f4cd179b6d5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这是不是一个美女似的城市？",
      "output_sha256": "039fed36b6ec4428cfd28770e26182d98e949b3bff8ecb4d57e75c91913f093f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "039fed36b6ec4428cfd28770e26182d98e949b3bff8ecb4d57e75c91913f093f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "再看看，假如城墙都被拆去，在城河的岸边，柳树成荫下修建平坦的马路，那是不是一个人间仙境？",
      "output_sha256": "69a13049c1fe9f14ba281c6a4464769abd403ce936238fba694f5cdfcacc38e1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.579172,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c55686c45d5129e2c4ee7709f9f6134ee03539a4a22235d0d5f7f8b5a3aebec2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_ai_sha256": "69a13049c1fe9f14ba281c6a4464769abd403ce936238fba694f5cdfcacc38e1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "看那城河的水，清澈、静谧、明亮，仿佛在对你诉说：你看看我多么甜美！",
      "output_sha256": "3fa2a4abff5c9d67046a78afa682f65717076fb7d1d7114be6048704689af891",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": 0.628758,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "380e86abed736439f81dcb1da998296223f091df61aba3dffa3f019dd20eeeb6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 28,
