    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "那水藻，一年四季老是那么绿，没有法形容，因为它们似乎是暗示出上帝心中的“绿”便是这样的绿。",
      "output_sha256": "04b9948601b9e9777ddb37ff6e089859c3574b55a220a12ad3fb072a41b5e91a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "04b9948601b9e9777ddb37ff6e089859c3574b55a220a12ad3fb072a41b5e91a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在河岸上，柳荫下，若有一些比济南妇女更美的浣纱姑娘，身穿白衫或红袄，宛若盛开的花朵，映照着自己的倒影，一边洗涤一边歌唱！",
      "output_sha256": "2aa2cfa051422c01dde66b5c44030df076ee0c18eed4f77cb5a45d89e13ca1bc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": 0.597102,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0721577da5a37f72f43b34357659bba9303f477f419af22df5001b2ea0249c8c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2aa2cfa051422c01dde66b5c44030df076ee0c18eed4f77cb5a45d89e13ca1bc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这是看风景呢，还是作梦呢？",
      "output_sha256": "798aa471a97362e938e54f51ae934868a2a08b816dd4960b47caeded873d6098",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "798aa471a97362e938e54f51ae934868a2a08b816dd4960b47caeded873d6098",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "一点也不是幻想；假如这座城在一个比中国人争气的民族手里，这个梦大概久已是事实了。",
      "output_sha256": "5c724e49c5046242610d4ff11e8d032be99395cee82418a6f8e3b8c3a0d7ba3e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "5c724e49c5046242610d4ff11e8d032be99395cee82418a6f8e3b8c3a0d7ba3e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我决不愿济南被别人管领；我希望中国人应当有比编几副对联或作几首诗（连大明湖上的游船都有很漂亮的对联，可惜没有湖！）",
      "output_sha256": "cb18816e18fc11291009f5e63c5003b097c34ebc2114e803b123b2e59fb5ba35",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "cb18816e18fc11291009f5e63c5003b097c34ebc2114e803b123b2e59fb5ba35",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "更大一些的想象。",
      "output_sha256": "89251f50191524c01df9225fc936d3efba5a8e2813945abb107a07be8e5d9855",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "89251f50191524c01df9225fc936d3efba5a8e2813945abb107a07be8e5d9855",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我请你想象，因为只有想象才足以揭露出济南的本来面目。",
      "output_sha256": "6a74da29e2533b48158e6f79de94ab0b4ab5732d7f53bd39fb22231fb50c0e9d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
